  "body": "Beautifully preserved and thoughtfully modernised, this impressive 330sqm villa brings together timeless character, generous proportions and contemporary family comfort in one of Cheltenham’s most coveted locations.\r\n\r\nBehind its classic façade, five bedrooms, four bathrooms and three generous living areas provide an exceptional sense of space and flexibility. Soaring ceilings, beautiful original detailing and the warmth of a character home celebrate its heritage, while considered updates ensure effortless modern living. The versatile layout easily adapts to every stage of family life - whether accommodating growing children, visiting guests, working from home, or simply creating separate spaces to relax and unwind.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home is its wonderful connection to the outdoors. Effortless indoor-outdoor flow opens to beautifully landscaped gardens and a stunning in-ground swimming pool, creating an idyllic setting for long summer days and relaxed evenings with family and friends.\r\n\r\nGet ready for the perfect beachside summer. With Cheltenham Beach just minutes away, days can begin with a morning swim and end back at home around the pool. There is ample room for endless and effortless summer entertaining - and with space like this, Christmas may well be at your place this year.\r\n\r\nFrom large family celebrations and long lunches in the sun to impromptu gatherings after the beach, this is a home designed to be enjoyed. The multiple living spaces allow everyone to come together when it matters, perfectly suited for entertaining or relaxed everyday family life.\r\n\r\nPositioned on a peaceful, tree-lined street, the location is every bit as special as the home itself. Cheltenham Beach, local cafés, Devonport Village, highly regarded schools and city ferry connections are all within easy reach, offering the sought-after combination of coastal living, community and convenience for which this tightly held neighbourhood is renowned.\r\n\r\nAn exquisite residence within the exclusive enclave surrounding Cheltenham Beach is increasingly hard to find - particularly one offering this combination of scale, character, flexibility, poolside living and proximity to the water.\r\n\r\nA rare opportunity to secure an exceptional family home and embrace an enviable beach lifestyle in the heart of iconic Cheltenham. Do not delay your viewing - summer is almost here.",
